{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most entertaining and challenging Clutter yet with over 1800 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The newest variation you won't want to miss are the Block Puzzles &amp; Split Takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/C18_gif_W600.gif?t=1746439936\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And just like regular Clutter levels, they are highly  addicting too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And wait until you see the new Variation on Pop-Ups and Clutter Pics (Holes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've never seen Clutter this challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As always, Favorites allow you to collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/FEATURES_LABEL_600PX.png?t=1746439936\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 1800 levels including a very challenging 100 level Main Quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extra easy No-Motion Old-School area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All new Block Puzzles and Split Takes that you won't believe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of picture puzzles and 200 new Box Quotes puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Joe's Favorite Music throughout the game with a Cinematic Feel</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com